OL,3,GNEWSAFree toothbrush packs to help
OL,4,Afamilies with hygiene
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome families will be given free
OL,7,Ftoothbrushes, toothpaste and teeth
OL,8,Fcleaning advice as part of efforts to
OL,9,Fimprove oral hygiene.
OL,11,FSelected schools and nurseries in West
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire will offer "supervised
OL,13,Ftoothbrushing programmes", as part of
OL,14,Fthe scheme by East of England Community
OL,15,FHealth and Care NHS Trust.
OL,17,FTeachers and care staff will be given
OL,18,Fadvice to promote oral health,
OL,19,F"particularly in communities where poor
OL,20,Fdental health outcomes are more
OL,21,Fcommon", the trust said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
