OL,3,GNEWSAFree toothbrush packs to help
OL,4,Afamilies with hygiene
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Couse, cabinet member for adult
OL,7,Fcare and public health at West
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire Council, said the
OL,9,Fservice was "about getting the basics
OL,10,Fright early".
